# Security & PII

- Never commit real secrets; use `.env.local` / `.env.example` placeholders.
- Mock personas must be synthetic (fake RFC/names).
- No real biometrics or vendor face payloads in ola 1.
- Site password protects the prototype; it is not fine-grained authZ.
- Do not log full PII in client consoles for “debugging demos.”
